\\                       or inside gp:   read("polynomial_F.gp")
\\ Definition:
\\        F(V,T) = V^23 + sum_{k=2}^{23} a_k(T) * V^(23-k),      a_1 = 0,
\\        a_k(T)  = b_k(T) / (T^2+23)^floor(5k/23),    b_k in Z[T],
\\        deg b_k = 2*floor(5k/23)  (attained for every k).
\\ ============================================================================

